Package: pppms
Title: Confidence Limits for Prediction Performance After Model Selection
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Pascal",
        family = "Rink",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "p.rink@uni-bremen.de"
    )
Description: Methods for multiplicity-adjusted bootstrap tilting lower
    confidence limits for prediction performance after selecting the
    empirically best candidate model. The package is designed for
    post-selection inference in comparative prediction settings and
    provides tools for confidence statements that account for the
    model-selection step.
